  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/feats/rampaging-form-frozen-wind.webp
  Description: Your willpower becomes truly unbreakable. Your proficiency rank for
    Will saves increases to legendary. When you roll a success at a Will save, you
    get a critical success. When you roll a critical failure at a Will save, you
    get a failure instead. When you roll a failure on a Will save against a damaging
    effect, you take half damage.
